{# SECTION 6 — HOW IT WORKS #}
<section class="section-technical py-4">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
    <h2 class="text-center mb-4">How it works: database virtualization retains your databases while eliminating your data silos</h2>
    <p>NEXTGRES sits on top of your existing databases as a virtualization layer—creating a single, unified view of your data without moving, consolidating, or replicating a single record. Your Postgres instance, your NoSQL store, your event streams—NEXTGRES queries across all of them as if they were one.</p>
    <p>If you eventually want to consolidate, you can. But you'll never have to.</p>
    <p>Onboarding is a guided setup with our team. After that, your martech and analytics teams are fully self-serve. No ongoing data engineering required.</p>
  </div>
</section>

